{"id":"2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first","date":"2026-11-13","topic":"apps","region":"americas","headline":"Apple Built Its First Big Order in a Garage","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_I"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, two friends started a computer business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t1-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.52,"times":[0.0,0.24,1.94,2.2,2.74,3.36,3.68,4.0]},{"text":"Steve Jobs and Steve Wozniak got a big order.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":3.6,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.45,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.64,1.12,1.44,2.16,2.5,2.68,2.98]},{"text":"A shop owner wanted fifty built computers right away.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":3.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":5.47,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.24,0.5,0.9,1.38,1.9,2.4,3.02]},{"text":"The young men had no money for the parts.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":2.47,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.69,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.22,0.46,0.74,1.06,1.46,1.76,1.84]},{"text":"They built the computer boards in a family garage.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.3,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":4.59,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.28,0.48,0.78,1.22,1.58,1.66,2.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":88,"core1800":2,"ngsl":0,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"In 1976,","title":"Time Modifier at Start","note":"Prepositional phrases indicating time can be placed at the start of a sentence. This sets the background context before introducing the subject and verb."},{"i":2,"focus":"built computers","title":"Past Participle as Adjective","note":"The word 'built' is the past participle of 'build' and acts as an adjective describing 'computers'. It tells us that the computers were already assembled."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, Steve Jobs and Steve Wozniak started Apple Computer.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O"],"dur":5.66,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.52,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.3,2.16,2.4,2.9,3.22,3.92,4.38,4.84]},{"text":"A shop owner named Paul Terrell ordered fifty assembled computers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.12,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.92,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.2,0.46,0.78,1.14,1.62,2.14,2.54,3.14]},{"text":"He agreed to pay five hundred dollars for each finished machine.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":5.33,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.5,0.64,1.04,1.34,1.72,2.02,2.26,2.64]},{"text":"The partners had little money, so Jobs asked for credit on parts.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","V","O","O","O"],"dur":3.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":7.09,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.24,0.58,0.9,1.62,1.72,2.0,2.38,2.66,2.96,3.26]},{"text":"They built the main circuit boards inside a family garage on time.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":5.65,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.44,0.64,0.98,1.38,1.78,2.04,2.4,2.76,3.2]},{"text":"People will always remember this clever start to a famous company.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.82,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.38,0.7,1.22,1.56,1.94,2.38,2.66,2.78,3.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":83,"core1800":5,"ngsl":0,"tsl":5,"nawl":2,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"named Paul Terrell","title":"Reduced Participle Modifier","note":"The past participle 'named' shortens the relative clause 'who was named'. It modifies 'A shop owner' directly and gives his name."},{"i":3,"focus":"so","title":"Coordinating Conjunction of Result","note":"The word 'so' connects two independent clauses. It shows that having little money caused Jobs to request credit."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, Steve Jobs and Steve Wozniak started Apple to sell computer parts.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":9.42,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.92,2.3,2.7,3.14,3.36,4.08,4.52,5.06,5.48,5.64,6.08]},{"text":"A shop owner named Paul Terrell offered to buy 50 Apple I computers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":5.94,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.26,0.54,0.94,1.34,1.92,2.4,2.58,2.76,3.32,3.84,4.14]},{"text":"Terrell insisted that the devices must include assembled circuit boards with attached components.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.64,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.87,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.8,1.14,1.24,1.54,2.1,2.62,3.3,3.68,4.08,4.46,4.74]},{"text":"The co-founders had sold personal items to raise $1,300, which was not enough money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","C","C","C"],"dur":5.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.07,"times":[0.0,0.17,0.68,0.8,1.02,1.34,1.9,2.24,2.99,4.0,4.34,4.48,4.74,4.96]},{"text":"Jobs showed the purchase order to a parts seller who gave them 30 days of credit.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.22,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":7.65,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.54,0.72,1.0,1.32,1.56,1.68,1.88,2.16,2.6,2.76,2.96,3.28,3.62,3.8]},{"text":"The small team assembled the electronic boards by hand inside the Jobs family garage.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.07,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":5.01,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.58,0.98,1.34,1.7,2.1,2.42,2.82,3.36,3.68,3.92,4.3]},{"text":"They delivered the finished order on time and earned money for the new business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":7.1,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.4,0.64,0.96,1.3,1.58,1.96,2.42,2.6,2.92,3.2,3.3,3.4]}],"bands":{"core1000":81,"core1800":10,"ngsl":0,"tsl":7,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"had sold","title":"Past Perfect Tense","note":"The past perfect 'had sold' shows an action that happened before another event in the past story. They sold their items prior to securing the store order."},{"i":4,"focus":"who gave them 30 days of credit","title":"Relative Clause with Double Objects","note":"The relative pronoun 'who' introduces details about the seller. Inside the clause, 'gave' takes an indirect object 'them' and a direct object '30 days of credit'."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In April 1976, Steve Jobs, Steve Wozniak, and Ronald Wayne formed Apple Computer as a partnership.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":8.12,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.94,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.54,1.84,2.64,3.46,3.7,4.72,4.82,5.06,5.48,6.08,6.44,7.02,7.36,7.46]},{"text":"To finance their early work, Jobs sold his microbus and Wozniak sold a scientific calculator.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":6.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":6.3,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.36,0.7,0.94,1.7,1.9,2.36,2.6,3.2,3.74,4.36,4.7,4.88,5.3]},{"text":"Paul Terrell, who managed the Byte Shop, offered to buy 50 units of the Apple I.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.08,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":6.05,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.94,0.98,1.28,1.6,1.84,2.52,2.88,3.02,3.2,3.66,4.04,4.3,4.4,4.56]},{"text":"However, Terrell specified that the units had to be delivered as fully assembled circuit boards.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":5.38,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.74,1.24,1.52,1.64,1.86,2.18,2.32,2.42,2.74,3.1,3.46,4.0,4.42]},{"text":"Because cash was limited, Jobs presented the purchase order to a distributor to obtain components on credit.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.71,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.5,0.76,1.52,1.68,2.16,2.42,2.68,2.98,3.24,3.36,3.82,4.2,4.4,4.98,5.38]},{"text":"The components were assembled into working units by the small team inside the Jobs family garage.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":5.5,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.3,0.64,0.96,1.32,1.66,2.16,2.42,2.52,2.8,3.16,3.7,3.98,4.22,4.56]},{"text":"After delivering the inventory on schedule, the founders were paid $500 per unit by the store owner.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.05,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.0,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.54,0.82,1.24,1.62,2.48,2.56,2.78,3.06,3.28,4.08,4.66,5.0,5.28,5.38,5.58]},{"text":"The Apple I was later introduced to the general public at a retail price of $666.66.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":6.13,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.24,0.64,0.9,1.16,1.62,1.92,2.0,2.24,2.56,3.06,3.12,3.36,3.8,4.14]}],"bands":{"core1000":75,"core1800":11,"ngsl":3,"tsl":9,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"To finance their early work,","title":"Infinitive Phrase of Purpose","note":"An infinitive phrase placed at the beginning of a sentence explains the goal or purpose of the main action. It tells us why Jobs and Wozniak sold their personal items."},{"i":6,"focus":"were paid $500 per unit","title":"Passive Voice with Retained Object","note":"When a verb taking two objects is changed to the passive voice, the direct object ($500 per unit) stays in place. The recipient ('the founders') becomes the subject."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"When Steve Wozniak and Steve Jobs founded Apple Computer in 1976, they initially planned to market bare circuit boards to hobbyists.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":13.56,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,1.28,1.58,1.88,2.14,2.9,3.16,3.7,4.02,5.54,5.74,6.06,6.48,6.8,7.04,7.4,7.8,8.18,8.5]},{"text":"That business strategy shifted dramatically when Paul Terrell, owner of the Byte Shop, placed an order for 50 Apple I computers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":8.76,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.44,1.0,1.44,1.92,2.58,2.88,3.64,3.88,4.06,4.16,4.34,5.06,5.24,5.44,5.64,5.92,6.38,6.72,7.08]},{"text":"Terrell offered $500 per unit on delivery, provided the microcomputers arrived completely assembled rather than as do-it-yourself kits.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-first/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":11.45,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,1.24,1.84,2.18,2.48,3.18,3.5,3.72,4.38,4.76,5.3,5.88,6.4,6.7,6.83,7.48]},{"text":"Lacking the capital required to purchase components, Jobs leveraged the signed purchase order to secure 30-day credit from an electronics distributor.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-apps-apple-built-its-f